        OTHERWISE JUST (`the Member State ensures that its representative on the Board has the relevant competences and powers in the Member State so as to contribute actively to the achievement of the Board's tasks referred to in Article 66`)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Member States shall ensure that their representatives on the Board have the relevant competences and powers in their Member State so as to contribute actively to the achievement of the Board's tasks referred to in Article 66"

