        OTHERWISE JUST (`the Member State ensures that its representative on the Board is empowered to facilitate consistency and coordination between national competent authorities in the Member State as regards the implementation of this Regulation, including through the collection of relevant data and information for the purpose of fulfilling their tasks on the Board`)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Member States shall ensure that their representatives on the Board are empowered to facilitate consistency and coordination between national competent authorities in their Member State as regards the implementation of this Regulation"

-- src:1018 | 5. The designated representatives of the Member States shall adopt the Board’s rules of procedure by a two-thirds majority. The rules of procedure shall, in particular, lay down procedures for the selection process, the duration of the mandate of, and specifications of the tasks of, the Chair, detailed arrangements for voting, and the organisation of the Board’s activities and those of its sub-groups.
@ref Art 65(5) first sentence (the two-thirds majority) (src:1018)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the number of designated representatives of the Member States who voted in favour` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of designated representatives of the Member States` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 65(5) the Board's rules of procedure have been adopted by a two-thirds majority` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`Art 64 the group of Chapter VII applies on the date asked` `the date asked`) THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Chapter VII applies from the date Art 113 gives
        OTHERWISE JUST ((`the number of designated representatives of the Member States who voted in favour` TIMES 3) AT LEAST (`the number of designated representatives of the Member States` TIMES 2))  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall adopt the Board's rules of procedure by a two-thirds majority" (two thirds of the designated representatives: fork F-65-5)

