    ELSE CONSIDER `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` `the date asked`
         WHEN `as enacted` THEN `Art 69(2) as enacted the implementing act sets out the structure and level of fees and the scale and structure of recoverable costs` `the structure and the level of fees are set out in the implementing act referred to in Article 68(1)` `the scale and structure of recoverable costs are set out in the implementing act referred to in Article 68(1)` `the implementing act takes into account the objectives of the adequate implementation of this Regulation, cost-effectiveness and the necessity of ensuring effective access to experts for all Member States`  -- VERSION as enacted
         WHEN `as amended` THEN NOTHING  -- VERSION as amended. NOTHING-kind (silent): the amended paragraph has one sentence; the structure and level of fees are no longer left to the implementing act (the rate is that of the Commission's remuneration fees)

