-- src:1093 | 2. Member States shall communicate to the Commission the identity of the notifying authorities and the market surveillance authorities and the tasks of those authorities, as well as any subsequent changes thereto. Member States shall make publicly available information on how competent authorities and single points of contact can be contacted, through electronic communication means by 2 August 2025. Member States shall designate a market surveillance authority to act as the single point of contact for this Regulation, and shall notify the Commission of the identity of the single point of contact. The Commission shall make a list of the single points of contact publicly available.
@ref Art 70(2) second sentence (the duty and its deadline) (src:1093)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the day from which the Member State is bound` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Art 70 party` `Art 70 act`
`Art 70(2) the Member State's duty to make publicly available the information on how competent authorities and single points of contact can be contacted` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Art 64 the group of Chapter VII applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: Chapter VII does not apply on the date asked
    ELSE
        PARTY `Art 70 Member State`
        MUST `Art 70(2) make the information on how competent authorities and single points of contact can be contacted publicly available`
        WITHIN (Day `Art 70(2) the date by which the information on how competent authorities and single points of contact can be contacted is to be made publicly available`) MINUS (Day `the day from which the Member State is bound`)
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST BREACH BY `Art 70 Member State` BECAUSE "the information on how competent authorities and single points of contact can be contacted was not made publicly available, through electronic communication means, by 2 August 2025"

