        IF `the national competent authority provides guidance and advice on the implementation of this Regulation` AND `the guidance and advice take into account the guidance and advice of the Board and the Commission` THEN JUST TRUE  -- the grant: "National competent authorities may provide guidance and advice on the implementation of this Regulation, in particular to SMEs, including start-ups, and SMCs, taking into account the guidance and advice of the Board and the Commission, as appropriate"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the case falls outside what the grant names

